      },
      {
        "text": "In a congressional campaign, the contribution limit is $2,900 before the primary and $2,900 after the primary.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The maximum amount an individual can contribute to a candidate over a two-year election cycle is $5,800.",
